WEBVTT

00:06:00.246 --> 00:06:02.079
And I've even wondered if, you know,

00:06:02.079 --> 00:06:05.621
if that's part of why the the George
Floyd protests, you know,

00:06:05.621 --> 00:06:06.788
really rose up when they did.

00:06:07.121 --> 00:06:11.163
I feel like before the pandemic,
people felt like, you know,

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:15.788
there's nothing that I personally can do
to fight systemic racism, whereas,

00:06:15.788 --> 00:06:19.871
you know, juxtaposed against a
global disease like covid,

00:06:20.371 --> 00:06:22.538
which I really can't fight. Well,
you know what?

00:06:22.538 --> 00:06:24.579
I could I could show up in protest.

00:06:25.371 --> 00:06:29.329
And so I guess there's there's something
about both holding fast to your beliefs

00:06:29.329 --> 00:06:32.538
that helps render an uncontrollable
world more controllable.